(7154332, 1096815, 153900, '<td valign="top">Even though I didn''t place it doesn''t worry me, your comments made it all worth while. So thank you all for the kind words. This idea came out of no where I was thinking about all the crazy toys my 3 kids have and then boom my youngest son was playing with this Lego and came up to me and said Daddy play Lego? He is 2 by the way. I grabbed it then it hit me miniature fruit Ninja perfect. So I ran to the store and got the fruit set everything up and took about 3 shots total before my trigger batteries decided to die. So again thank you all you guys made my day!<br/> <br/>Doug</td>', 'Even though I didn''t place it doesn''t worry me, your comments made it all worth while. So thank you all for the kind words. This idea came out of no where I was thinking about all the crazy toys my 3 kids have and then boom my youngest son was playing with this Lego and came up to me and said Daddy play Lego? He is 2 by the way. I grabbed it then it hit me miniature fruit Ninja perfect. So I ran to the store and got the fruit set everything up and took about 3 shots total before my trigger batteries decided to die. So again thank you all you guys made my day! Doug', '2014-01-08 09:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
